  "customfield_10187": null,
  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Currently, an LDP-NR is created whenever:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "a) content-type of a POST or PUT request is not RDF",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "or",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "b) Content-Disposition: attachment header is present",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "At present, this is not codified in the specification draft doc:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ad3MhTQWGof0IJ03yY5jVofCK8uO9yPKMVXVYq7a44o/edit#"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1ad3MhTQWGof0IJ03yY5jVofCK8uO9yPKMVXVYq7a44o/edit#",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The LDP spec is fairly silent about when a repository should create an LDP-NR.  This ticket is to see if there is a better way (possibly leveraging LDP headers) to explicitly convey a client's intent that a given resource should be created as a LDP-NR, and incorporate the conclusion into the spec draft.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "A case to consider is persisting an arbitrary RDF document (e.g. an owl document, RDF-based dataset, etc) as a binary resource in Fedora with an rdf media type.  This case precludes (a) from the above techniques for specifying binary resource creation.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "See discussion in ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1081"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1081",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
